{"body":{"says":"One expression, of the author's or of whoever its voice says, as one message: a stretch of time in which his words bounce off each other more than off the same words elsewhere. Its parts are paragraphs and breaks, in order."},"id":"01M6RBNRG13EAC8X77SR0W8A2S","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"as":{"says":"How it came: typed or spoken.","shape":"string"},"flow":{"holds":true,"says":"Its paragraphs and breaks, in order.","shape":{"list":"ref"}},"order":{"says":"Its place in the session.","shape":"number"},"voice":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"Who speaks it.","shape":"ref"}},"name":"utterance","prev":"sha256-2e9d90603b59f4af733d809cfdef26051b1f9162f07c2ef41b0e62b7b64f31ad"}
{"body":{"says":"One thing a source says, as a holon of its own: what it is about, the figure and its unit, the moment it was true for, and the source that says it. Two sources saying different things of the same are two claims, and both stand."},"id":"01M6SMRS96KJKRCSEA7PV9NRVN","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"about":{"says":"What the claim is of, in words.","shape":"string"},"asOf":{"optional":true,"says":"The moment it was true for, as the source gives it.","shape":"string"},"by":{"holds":false,"says":"The source that says it.","shape":"ref"},"figure":{"optional":true,"says":"The figure, as a number.","shape":"number"},"says":{"says":"The claim in prose, as the source gave it.","shape":"string"},"unit":{"optional":true,"says":"What the figure counts.","shape":"string"}},"name":"claim","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"A field following a source: at what pace, through which relay if any, and for how long. A poll is a run of it, and a poll that finds something new becomes one commit."},"id":"01M6SMRS97AQWZ39VEAS0TY8TB","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"into":{"says":"The store its entries are committed into.","shape":"string"},"lifetime":{"optional":true,"says":"When the following ends, decided at its start.","shape":"string"},"pace":{"says":"How often it is asked, as the follower chooses.","shape":"string"},"source":{"holds":false,"says":"What is followed.","shape":"ref"},"through":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The relay it is followed through, if one.","shape":"ref"}},"name":"following","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"The line of hygiene as data: for a source, what may enter the field, what may be drawn from it at reading, and what may be shared onward. The engine is to judge acts against it, as it judges every act against what the field declares."},"id":"01M6SMRS9757EN4EPGKGT1F2XH","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"because":{"says":"What grants it: a licence, the author's word, a platform's terms, or the law's exceptions.","shape":"string"},"draw":{"says":"What may be drawn from the source at the moment of reading.","shape":"string"},"enter":{"says":"What may be held in one's own field.","shape":"string"},"of":{"holds":false,"says":"The source or work it rules.","shape":"ref"},"share":{"says":"What may be shared onward, and on what terms.","shape":"string"}},"name":"permission","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"Who speaks: an author, a session, a fork, a writer read from outside. An utterance says its voice by pointing at one."},"id":"01M6SMRS977B9PNDXB497RY8NS","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"of":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The holon it is the voice of, where there is one: a session, a source.","shape":"ref"},"title":{"says":"The voice in a few words.","shape":"string"}},"name":"voice","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"A holon that stands for another in fewer words: not a version of it, since a version is the same holon changed, but a holon of its own pointing at what it condenses. Where the fuller original was never kept, it says so."},"id":"01M6SMRS97QETTXE770P1KFXQF","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"condenses":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The fuller original, where it is kept.","shape":"ref"},"of":{"optional":true,"says":"In words, what it condenses, where the original is not a holon.","shape":"string"},"utterance":{"holds":false,"says":"The condensed utterance itself.","shape":"ref"}},"name":"condensation","prev":null}
